tags: party_affairs
view-if: campaigning_timer <= 0
on-arrival: campaigning_timer = 6

= Campaign Blitz

Every election is decided by who shows up. Where should we deploy our surrogates and ads?

- @blue_wall: Industrial heartland
- @suburban_push: Suburban professionals
- @rights_turnout: Mobilize our base
- @sun_belt: Sun Belt expansion
- @easy_discard

@blue_wall
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; working_dem += 5*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); labor_dissent -= 3; month_actions += 1

We flood Pennsylvania, Michigan, and Ohio with ads, surrogates, and union canvassers.

@suburban_push
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; suburban_dem += 5*(1-dissent); educated_dem += 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 2; month_actions += 1

Targeted mail and digital ads speak to suburban parents worried about schools, healthcare, and extremism.

@rights_turnout
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; minority_dem += 5*(1-dissent); young_dem += 3*(1-dissent); dem_enthusiasm += 0.5; month_actions += 1

We invest in churches, campuses, and community centers. Turnout in our core groups rises.

@sun_belt
subtitle: -1 resource
unavailable-subtitle: Need 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: resources -= 1; minority_dem += 3*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); month_actions += 1

Arizona, Georgia, North Carolina: long-term investment pays early dividends.
